---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Publications | Amirhossein Eskorouchi"
  description="Selected publications and scholarly outputs by Amirhossein Eskorouchi."
>
  <article class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Publications</h1>
      <p class="page-introduction">
        Peer-reviewed publications and related scholarly outputs.
      </p>
    </header>

    <p class="note">
      This page establishes the publication structure. We will next transfer the
      verified citations from the academic CV and connect each record to its paper,
      project page, code, poster, presentation, and dataset where available.
    </p>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Organization</h2>

      <p>
        Publications will be presented chronologically and grouped only where doing
        so improves navigation. Each record will use the official title, complete
        author list, venue, year, and publication status.
      </p>

      <p>
        Related materials will be linked directly beneath each citation so that
        visitors can move from a publication to its technical evidence without
        searching elsewhere.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <p>
        Relevant project summaries are available on the
        <a href="/projects">Projects page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
